(3086981, 434374, 36606, '<td valign="top">larus? well I reckon this has got to win. The rest are complete RUBBISH. lol 10</td>', 'larus? well I reckon this has got to win. The rest are complete RUBBISH. lol 10', '2006-12-04 16:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3087070, 433852, 45475, '<td valign="top">Oh that is sooooo wrong on so many levels!!! lmao! The way I see it, this is the type of challenge that one can choose to go either of two ways; Do the whole "serious" movie poster style replica, or, let the imagination fly. And boy-oh-boy, you''ve let loose with your imagination here! Thank you, in all honesty, I much prefer humour and humour done well. Instant fav!<br/> <br/>On a wee technical point, could be resize is the culprit, but the edges around Kermit''s suit seem a little jaggy? Not sure how you''d remedy that as I still struggle with fine lines myself at times, but if you ever decide to print, might be an idea to play around with feathering (or maybe Smart Blur in PS?). In any event, it hasn''t detracted from the enjoyable experience one iota! Good luck!</td>', 'Oh that is sooooo wrong on so many levels!!! lmao! The way I see it, this is the type of challenge that one can choose to go either of two ways; Do the whole "serious" movie poster style replica, or, let the imagination fly. And boy-oh-boy, you''ve let loose with your imagination here! Thank you, in all honesty, I much prefer humour and humour done well. Instant fav! On a wee technical point, could be resize is the culprit, but the edges around Kermit''s suit seem a little jaggy? Not sure how you''d remedy that as I still struggle with fine lines myself at times, but if you ever decide to print, might be an idea to play around with feathering (or maybe Smart Blur in PS?). In any event, it hasn''t detracted from the enjoyable experience one iota! Good luck!', '2006-12-04 16:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3087077, 434410, 45475, '<td valign="top">Nice. This reminds me a little of the dvd cover for Goldfinger (girl in bed/shadow on wall). Fantastic work on the shadow, well done!</td>', 'Nice. This reminds me a little of the dvd cover for Goldfinger (girl in bed/shadow on wall). Fantastic work on the shadow, well done!', '2006-12-04 16:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
