(3088278, 433962, 39243, '<td valign="top">This reminds me more of the movie "The Thing" with Kurt Russel. check out this web site //www.imdb.com/title/tt0084787/posters and you will see what I mean - none the less neat picture.</td>', 'This reminds me more of the movie "The Thing" with Kurt Russel. check out this web site //www.imdb.com/title/tt0084787/posters and you will see what I mean - none the less neat picture.', '2006-12-05 03:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088282, 434477, 39243, '<td valign="top">good picture - not sure I get it for this challenge. Unless you mean the sound "tattoo" produced by the bird? I didn''t read the book so I am not sure if there is one in it. Good luck.</td>', 'good picture - not sure I get it for this challenge. Unless you mean the sound "tattoo" produced by the bird? I didn''t read the book so I am not sure if there is one in it. Good luck.', '2006-12-05 03:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088290, 434372, 56400, '<td valign="top">(Big Sigh)I remember being limber and able to bend in strange and interesting ways. Now, this hurts my back just to look at it.<br/>Nice job though.</td>', '(Big Sigh)I remember being limber and able to bend in strange and interesting ways. Now, this hurts my back just to look at it.Nice job though.', '2006-12-05 04:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088292, 434338, 60183, '<td valign="top">There may have been a significant lose of quality somewhere in the editting process.  Also, you can see reflections in the metal.</td>', 'There may have been a significant lose of quality somewhere in the editting process.  Also, you can see reflections in the metal.', '2006-12-05 04:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088300, 433625, 39243, '<td valign="top">THAT is awesome - 8 for the effort!</td>', 'THAT is awesome - 8 for the effort!', '2006-12-05 04:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088305, 434382, 39243, '<td valign="top">could you have chosen a more ratty set of cards? the blue dot and the cards really distract from the picture.</td>', 'could you have chosen a more ratty set of cards? the blue dot and the cards really distract from the picture.', '2006-12-05 04:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088385, 434382, 30049, '<td valign="top">Dang. I like this shot, but why go to all the trouble of putting this together and NOT buy a new deck of cards?  Really takes away from this IMO.  Cool thought on changing the eye color - perhaps a little rushed as you can still see blue in the upper right area of the iris.  I also wish that her hair went all the way to the edge of the frame on the left as the gap top left is a little distracting.  Keep at it.  You have the creative juices, just need a little more attention to details.  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Dang. I like this shot, but why go to all the trouble of putting this together and NOT buy a new deck of cards?  Really takes away from this IMO.  Cool thought on changing the eye color - perhaps a little rushed as you can still see blue in the upper right area of the iris.  I also wish that her hair went all the way to the edge of the frame on the left as the gap top left is a little distracting.  Keep at it.  You have the creative juices, just need a little more attention to details.  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-05 06:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088410, 434466, 67671, '<td valign="top">Gold taps are a nice touch</td>', 'Gold taps are a nice touch', '2006-12-05 06:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088420, 434391, 67671, '<td valign="top">Good shot, great outfit, but the location lets it down a bit, speciely the fence at the back, makes it look a bit like your back garden, subject is excelent.</td>', 'Good shot, great outfit, but the location lets it down a bit, speciely the fence at the back, makes it look a bit like your back garden, subject is excelent.', '2006-12-05 06:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088435, 434372, 67671, '<td valign="top">like the pose, and the backdrop, not sure I like the glass where it is, thats not to say it''s wrong, more personal preffs, nicely focussed on the subject, excelent.</td>', 'like the pose, and the backdrop, not sure I like the glass where it is, thats not to say it''s wrong, more personal preffs, nicely focussed on the subject, excelent.', '2006-12-05 06:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088449, 434432, 61191, '<td valign="top">A rake and several moons? Well I think you should have tried this with ONE moon. Print out a shot of the moon and combine it with the rake. That would have worked better IMHO.</td>', 'A rake and several moons? Well I think you should have tried this with ONE moon. Print out a shot of the moon and combine it with the rake. That would have worked better IMHO.', '2006-12-05 07:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088454, 434477, 61191, '<td valign="top">I recently watched the whole James Bond series again but I don''t know what the "man with the red tattoo" could be. Ok, the pecker has a red spot. But I don''t see any coincidence here, sorry. Maybe something in a movie inspired you to do this but it is too vague. If you shoot a pecker for a James Bond challenge you must show a strong link IMHO.</td>', 'I recently watched the whole James Bond series again but I don''t know what the "man with the red tattoo" could be. Ok, the pecker has a red spot. But I don''t see any coincidence here, sorry. Maybe something in a movie inspired you to do this but it is too vague. If you shoot a pecker for a James Bond challenge you must show a strong link IMHO.', '2006-12-05 07:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088459, 434455, 61191, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but composition and lighting could be better. The rounds for example look better if they are only few (3 or so) and then positioned wisely.<br/>BTW: JB doesn''t drink that Martini but a Vodka Martini (vodka, gin, vermouth). (Of course I don''t give you a lower vote because of that)</td>', 'Nice idea but composition and lighting could be better. The rounds for example look better if they are only few (3 or so) and then positioned wisely.BTW: JB doesn''t drink that Martini but a Vodka Martini (vodka, gin, vermouth). (Of course I don''t give you a lower vote because of that)', '2006-12-05 07:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088461, 433853, 61191, '<td valign="top">Yes, very nice! I love the vintage look you created here. Lighting and colors are excellent. She has a beautiful but shy expression - that works. Minus: too less negative space above her head. That makes the shot a bit "narrow" if you know what I mean.</td>', 'Yes, very nice! I love the vintage look you created here. Lighting and colors are excellent. She has a beautiful but shy expression - that works. Minus: too less negative space above her head. That makes the shot a bit "narrow" if you know what I mean.', '2006-12-05 07:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088465, 433197, 61191, '<td valign="top">Is this a handbag? Hmm... sorry, I don''t get it. However it is a nice shot.</td>', 'Is this a handbag? Hmm... sorry, I don''t get it. However it is a nice shot.', '2006-12-05 07:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088481, 434351, 61191, '<td valign="top">Now THIS is great!! I think this is the only shot that has a true JB vintage atmoshpere. Love the make up of the model: very 60''s! Her facial expression could not be better. Great attention to detail, everthing fits here. I sooo hope to see this getting the blue! 10 from me.</td>', 'Now THIS is great!! I think this is the only shot that has a true JB vintage atmoshpere. Love the make up of the model: very 60''s! Her facial expression could not be better. Great attention to detail, everthing fits here. I sooo hope to see this getting the blue! 10 from me.', '2006-12-05 07:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
