(3088577, 433645, 44878, '<td valign="top">Its a Nice Photo but on the Humourous side she looks like she is Bursting for the Loo !<br/>Well done though</td>', 'Its a Nice Photo but on the Humourous side she looks like she is Bursting for the Loo !Well done though', '2006-12-05 08:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088581, 434215, 44878, '<td valign="top">Very Nice colouring of the subject</td>', 'Very Nice colouring of the subject', '2006-12-05 08:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088591, 434429, 45194, '<td valign="top">Ok, you have to prove me right here. I was just saying to my friend that if someone does a "splash" shot right they nearly always ribbon.  He saw this splash shot and said, "this this will ribbon?"  "Yeah," I said..."thats a ribbon."  It''s a good shot, don''t get me wrong, it''s just a little cliche around here. I sort of hope it''s your first attempt at a splash shot and that you haven''t ribboned before with splash shots. Good luck. I gave you a high score for good technicals!</td>', 'Ok, you have to prove me right here. I was just saying to my friend that if someone does a "splash" shot right they nearly always ribbon.  He saw this splash shot and said, "this this will ribbon?"  "Yeah," I said..."thats a ribbon."  It''s a good shot, don''t get me wrong, it''s just a little cliche around here. I sort of hope it''s your first attempt at a splash shot and that you haven''t ribboned before with splash shots. Good luck. I gave you a high score for good technicals!', '2006-12-05 08:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088594, 433896, 45194, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting technique you pulled off here. A real good concept and well executed. I''m curious to see how it scores.  I didn''t pick it as one of the ribbon contenders since there were several I liked a little better but a friend of mine thinks you''ll ribbon.  Now I''m curious.  Good luck!</td>', 'I really like the lighting technique you pulled off here. A real good concept and well executed. I''m curious to see how it scores.  I didn''t pick it as one of the ribbon contenders since there were several I liked a little better but a friend of mine thinks you''ll ribbon.  Now I''m curious.  Good luck!', '2006-12-05 08:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088597, 434133, 45194, '<td valign="top">I really like the halo effect you have going here.  I''m not real fond of the wall paper though and I can''t really read your facial expression.  It''s almost a look of "I don''t want to see this when I shoot you" or maybe "I don''t want you to splatter my clothes when I shoot you." Either way it looks almost as if you''re reluctant to pull the trigger which sort of makes the picture odd for me.</td>', 'I really like the halo effect you have going here.  I''m not real fond of the wall paper though and I can''t really read your facial expression.  It''s almost a look of "I don''t want to see this when I shoot you" or maybe "I don''t want you to splatter my clothes when I shoot you." Either way it looks almost as if you''re reluctant to pull the trigger which sort of makes the picture odd for me.', '2006-12-05 08:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088601, 434434, 45194, '<td valign="top">Two things hurt you here in my opinion. First, the image is fuzzy and jagged around the edges and second, the colors are almost "Austin Powers" like rather than Bond (though I realize Austin Powers parody''s Bond films).  I thinks nude sillohette could have been THE way to go on a Bond challenge but this didn''t capture it the way I would have imagined. Gave you a 5 but could have been much higher with a few things fixed.  Good luck.</td>', 'Two things hurt you here in my opinion. First, the image is fuzzy and jagged around the edges and second, the colors are almost "Austin Powers" like rather than Bond (though I realize Austin Powers parody''s Bond films).  I thinks nude sillohette could have been THE way to go on a Bond challenge but this didn''t capture it the way I would have imagined. Gave you a 5 but could have been much higher with a few things fixed.  Good luck.', '2006-12-05 08:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088606, 434207, 45194, '<td valign="top">While it is a very good photo and the model has a striking appearance, nothing about it really rings of "Bond."  The outfit doesn''t appear Russian to me and the mountain effect in the background, while a good idea, doesn''t componsate enough to make it appear like "Russia."  Good technicals on the photo but this doesn''t nail the challenge in my opinion so I''m giving you an average score.</td>', 'While it is a very good photo and the model has a striking appearance, nothing about it really rings of "Bond."  The outfit doesn''t appear Russian to me and the mountain effect in the background, while a good idea, doesn''t componsate enough to make it appear like "Russia."  Good technicals on the photo but this doesn''t nail the challenge in my opinion so I''m giving you an average score.', '2006-12-05 08:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088614, 433798, 69280, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. I love the dramatic lighting. The best Casino Royale shot!!</td>', 'This is a great shot. I love the dramatic lighting. The best Casino Royale shot!!', '2006-12-05 09:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088615, 433685, 69280, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this shot! Nice Work.</td>', 'I like the colors in this shot! Nice Work.', '2006-12-05 09:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088708, 434374, 57851, '<td valign="top">Úllala, ég kannast nú svolítið við þessi tvö. Mikið hrikalega er Haukur flottur sem Bond =) Snilld</td>', 'Úllala, ég kannast nú svolítið við þessi tvö. Mikið hrikalega er Haukur flottur sem Bond =) Snilld', '2006-12-05 09:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
