(3089416, 434225, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great focus on the eyes. Very Bond-like features ;) The only nitpicks I have with it is a) I think I would have pushed the midtones a bit more, and; b) positioned the light differently to avoid shadow across the face.<br/> <br/>That''s it for me. I think this is a great entry for the challenge, good luck!</td>', 'Great focus on the eyes. Very Bond-like features ;) The only nitpicks I have with it is a) I think I would have pushed the midtones a bit more, and; b) positioned the light differently to avoid shadow across the face. That''s it for me. I think this is a great entry for the challenge, good luck!', '2006-12-05 15:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
