(3089447, 434385, 41409, '<td valign="top">While this is a good shot, I don''t think it really meets the challenge very well.  For starters, James Bond never drove a Viper ;)  I think that the glass should either be in the center or off to one of the sides, not in between.  You could have also tried to put the entire image in focus and try to get a nice refraction in the glass.</td>', 'While this is a good shot, I don''t think it really meets the challenge very well.  For starters, James Bond never drove a Viper ;)  I think that the glass should either be in the center or off to one of the sides, not in between.  You could have also tried to put the entire image in focus and try to get a nice refraction in the glass.', '2006-12-05 15:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3089454, 434391, 41409, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the burning all over the image, especially on the sky.  It''s kind of distracting.</td>', 'I don''t really like the burning all over the image, especially on the sky.  It''s kind of distracting.', '2006-12-05 15:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3089455, 434110, 45475, '<td valign="top">I''ve had to come back to this one a couple of times as I couldn''t put my finger on what was bothering me about it. This time I got it :) Contrast. Maybe even a play around with levels adjustment? Something to get the blacks deeper, whites lighter and the colours to pack a punch. Other than that, awesome portrait composition. Good luck!</td>', 'I''ve had to come back to this one a couple of times as I couldn''t put my finger on what was bothering me about it. This time I got it :) Contrast. Maybe even a play around with levels adjustment? Something to get the blacks deeper, whites lighter and the colours to pack a punch. Other than that, awesome portrait composition. Good luck!', '2006-12-05 15:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3089456, 434432, 41409, '<td valign="top">Haha.</td>', 'Haha.', '2006-12-05 15:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
