(3099085, 434257, 64097, '<td valign="top">i love the way that the lemon peel just makes the photo</td>', 'i love the way that the lemon peel just makes the photo', '2006-12-08 04:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099776, 434357, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''ve only watched a couple of James Bonds movies years ago, and this photo is immediately identifiable.  Well done on getting the message across.  You did a nice job in framing this composition considering it''s nearly a square crop.  Skin tones (face especially) have good color and detail - not washed out.  The left eye (from viewing perspective) looks to have a ''dodging'' circular area of white (whiter than surrounding area) in the lower off-center area.  I wouldn''t mention it normally, but for some reason it kind of jumps out at me.  In the overall scheme of things that observation is so very minor.<br/> <br/>Clever use of props.  :D  Didn''t that hurt your teeth?!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I''ve only watched a couple of James Bonds movies years ago, and this photo is immediately identifiable.  Well done on getting the message across.  You did a nice job in framing this composition considering it''s nearly a square crop.  Skin tones (face especially) have good color and detail - not washed out.  The left eye (from viewing perspective) looks to have a ''dodging'' circular area of white (whiter than surrounding area) in the lower off-center area.  I wouldn''t mention it normally, but for some reason it kind of jumps out at me.  In the overall scheme of things that observation is so very minor. Clever use of props.  :D  Didn''t that hurt your teeth?!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-12-08 12:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
