(3101141, 432559, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''m familiar with the movie title, but haven''t seen it.  Is there really a fish in a martini glass?  I think you''re having a little fun here aren''t you?  :D  It''s actually a pretty cool photo and it''s one of my top picks for this challenge.  You did a nice job with the lighting and it''s certainly sharp enough.  Should do ok for you both in the challenge and as a print or stock photo.  Good luck.</td>', 'Ok, I''m familiar with the movie title, but haven''t seen it.  Is there really a fish in a martini glass?  I think you''re having a little fun here aren''t you?  :D  It''s actually a pretty cool photo and it''s one of my top picks for this challenge.  You did a nice job with the lighting and it''s certainly sharp enough.  Should do ok for you both in the challenge and as a print or stock photo.  Good luck.', '2006-12-08 21:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101148, 433891, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clever and creative.  I''m sure you''ve heard that one a few times by now.  :D  It''s quite a fun photo.  Nice job of getting a solid portrait to begin with.  I like your choice of composing him within the frame - works well with the angle, off-centering, and including what you have of his face and head.  The black background was a smart choice for isolating the subject and eliminating any distractions.  Finally, a wonderful job of post-processing the eyes for this unforgetable image.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Clever and creative.  I''m sure you''ve heard that one a few times by now.  :D  It''s quite a fun photo.  Nice job of getting a solid portrait to begin with.  I like your choice of composing him within the frame - works well with the angle, off-centering, and including what you have of his face and head.  The black background was a smart choice for isolating the subject and eliminating any distractions.  Finally, a wonderful job of post-processing the eyes for this unforgetable image.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-12-08 21:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101163, 434026, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good use of props available to generate an image for this challenge.  I like the way you''ve put the pieces together for this (toy car position, and "gunman" position).  There seems to be a couple issues with the background area.  The toy car is quite noisy in places, like you did some burning and it introduced some noise.  The foreground black is fairly solid yet the areas in front and over the car look to show some selectioning leftovers and aren''t solid black as they should be.  All JMO of course.  Probably doomed from the beginning with the use of toy pieces.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good use of props available to generate an image for this challenge.  I like the way you''ve put the pieces together for this (toy car position, and "gunman" position).  There seems to be a couple issues with the background area.  The toy car is quite noisy in places, like you did some burning and it introduced some noise.  The foreground black is fairly solid yet the areas in front and over the car look to show some selectioning leftovers and aren''t solid black as they should be.  All JMO of course.  Probably doomed from the beginning with the use of toy pieces.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-08 21:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101168, 433445, 30049, '<td valign="top">Some potential here with the idea.  The pupil and iris are clear, but the remainder of the photo is a bit noisy/grainy.  Just not "clean" enough for the "wow" factor IMO.  The lines above and below the pupil are somewhat distracting as well.  All JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Some potential here with the idea.  The pupil and iris are clear, but the remainder of the photo is a bit noisy/grainy.  Just not "clean" enough for the "wow" factor IMO.  The lines above and below the pupil are somewhat distracting as well.  All JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-12-08 21:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101470, 434366, 45475, '<td valign="top">Nice set up with great light and colour saturation. A couple of points though: The image appears slightly grainy/noisy, and; I think resize may have played havoc with edges of the gun as some areas seem rather jagged. <br/> <br/>I love your chess pieces by the way :) Good luck with the challenge! <i>bump</i></td>', 'Nice set up with great light and colour saturation. A couple of points though: The image appears slightly grainy/noisy, and; I think resize may have played havoc with edges of the gun as some areas seem rather jagged.  I love your chess pieces by the way :) Good luck with the challenge! bump', '2006-12-09 00:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101471, 434462, 45475, '<td valign="top">hehehehe :D Love the title! Nice work on the lighting and set up here, well done! <i>bump</i></td>', 'hehehehe :D Love the title! Nice work on the lighting and set up here, well done! bump', '2006-12-09 00:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101473, 434273, 45475, '<td valign="top">Lovely night shot. Branches are always going to be a great way to frame the moon within a composition, and you''ve done very well. Good eye. If you are able to, run the image through a noise removal filter. More for the right side of the image than anything else, as the trunk and surrounding branches appear to have a lot of noise. Good luck with the challenge! :) <i>bump</i></td>', 'Lovely night shot. Branches are always going to be a great way to frame the moon within a composition, and you''ve done very well. Good eye. If you are able to, run the image through a noise removal filter. More for the right side of the image than anything else, as the trunk and surrounding branches appear to have a lot of noise. Good luck with the challenge! :) bump', '2006-12-09 00:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101474, 434338, 45475, '<td valign="top">Of course! "Shaken, not stirred". Well done :) <i>bump</i></td>', 'Of course! "Shaken, not stirred". Well done :) bump', '2006-12-09 00:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
