(3103952, 434410, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea with the shadow.  But the rest of the image could use some help.  Less clutter would be better, loose the spotted cover and the too yellow sheets, add some leg with heels.</td>', 'Nice idea with the shadow.  But the rest of the image could use some help.  Less clutter would be better, loose the spotted cover and the too yellow sheets, add some leg with heels.', '2006-12-10 12:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
