(3103970, 434133, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and angle down the barrel, burning for outline of figure.  The wallpaper in the background somewhat kills the Bond feeling that''s in the rest of the image.  With advanced editing, also consider removing the wallpaper seam down the right.</td>', 'Nice pose and angle down the barrel, burning for outline of figure.  The wallpaper in the background somewhat kills the Bond feeling that''s in the rest of the image.  With advanced editing, also consider removing the wallpaper seam down the right.', '2006-12-10 12:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
