(3105589, 432964, 44819, '<td valign="top">Wow! Thanks for all the positive comments. Regarding how I took the photo here is the original image.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=437178" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/44819/thumb/437178.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/44819/thumb/437178.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/44819/thumb/437178.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>The gun barrel was printed out. The hardest part was setting the timer and running 10meters to position myself for the shot.<br/> <br/>Cheers!<br/>GT</td>', 'Wow! Thanks for all the positive comments. Regarding how I took the photo here is the original image.   The gun barrel was printed out. The hardest part was setting the timer and running 10meters to position myself for the shot. Cheers!GT', '2006-12-11 03:51:28.000000', NULL, 0),
