(3105844, 434215, 50695, '<td valign="top">How do you get those round numbers? I gave this a 6. I thought it was a very pretty shot with great lighting, but no special quirk to move me. I bet if you had set up the props yourself it would have had that little something that makes all the difference. But as I''ve said, congratulations on not using a tuxedo or a gun or a Martini, for that matter.</td>', 'How do you get those round numbers? I gave this a 6. I thought it was a very pretty shot with great lighting, but no special quirk to move me. I bet if you had set up the props yourself it would have had that little something that makes all the difference. But as I''ve said, congratulations on not using a tuxedo or a gun or a Martini, for that matter.', '2006-12-11 08:35:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3105851, 433688, 58728, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I am shocked that this didn''t place higher.  I think it''s a great picture....excellent composition, I love the shallow dof...  I had given it a 10. One of my faves from the challenge.  ;)</td>', 'Wow.  I am shocked that this didn''t place higher.  I think it''s a great picture....excellent composition, I love the shallow dof...  I had given it a 10. One of my faves from the challenge.  ;)', '2006-12-11 08:41:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3105854, 434468, 50695, '<td valign="top">in the shot that inspired you, the blur emphasizes the perspective, which emphasizes how close the gun is to the viewer, which adds drama. Your blurred portion seems equally blurred, which actually has a flattening effect. plus your gun''s not long enough to show perspective lines. Size does matter sometimes. As to my score, I give inventiveness a premium, so a man holding a gun in a Bond challenge is going to have to work hard to get a good score from me. I don''t think any of them got over a 6. I gave you a 5 because of the problems above. I also don''t like blank backgrounds.</td>', 'in the shot that inspired you, the blur emphasizes the perspective, which emphasizes how close the gun is to the viewer, which adds drama. Your blurred portion seems equally blurred, which actually has a flattening effect. plus your gun''s not long enough to show perspective lines. Size does matter sometimes. As to my score, I give inventiveness a premium, so a man holding a gun in a Bond challenge is going to have to work hard to get a good score from me. I don''t think any of them got over a 6. I gave you a 5 because of the problems above. I also don''t like blank backgrounds.', '2006-12-11 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3105860, 433445, 50695, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t crazy about this one. Using a logo to represent something is too obvious, and the eye reflection isn''t original. I know that people use DPC to learn by trying other people''s ideas, and that''s great, but it''s not going to get the big score from me. It''s also not an appealing close-up. The color''s a little funky and the eyeball has strange highlights in it.</td>', 'I wasn''t crazy about this one. Using a logo to represent something is too obvious, and the eye reflection isn''t original. I know that people use DPC to learn by trying other people''s ideas, and that''s great, but it''s not going to get the big score from me. It''s also not an appealing close-up. The color''s a little funky and the eyeball has strange highlights in it.', '2006-12-11 08:47:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3105869, 434207, 15711, '<td valign="top">That''s one handsome guy.  Good job and congrats.</td>', 'That''s one handsome guy.  Good job and congrats.', '2006-12-11 08:54:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3105879, 434026, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the use of toys in an image. It reminds me that all photography is an illusion. I gave this a 6, the same score I gave the blue ribbon. To get more than a 6 from me, I need something extra. Perhaps some way for me to connect the man with Bond besides the gun... like if you''d made him some sunglasses!</td>', 'I like the use of toys in an image. It reminds me that all photography is an illusion. I gave this a 6, the same score I gave the blue ribbon. To get more than a 6 from me, I need something extra. Perhaps some way for me to connect the man with Bond besides the gun... like if you''d made him some sunglasses!', '2006-12-11 09:00:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3105890, 433376, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think you should have had more thumb. This just looked like a product shot to me and I just gave it a 5 and passed on by. A more assertive thumb would have stopped me and forced me to appreciate this more... because really it''s not a product at all. It''s more like an assemblage. And nicely lit, too.</td>', 'I think you should have had more thumb. This just looked like a product shot to me and I just gave it a 5 and passed on by. A more assertive thumb would have stopped me and forced me to appreciate this more... because really it''s not a product at all. It''s more like an assemblage. And nicely lit, too.', '2006-12-11 09:04:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3105898, 433625, 50695, '<td valign="top">This was already gone by the time I voted, but I would have definitely given this a 10. At least!</td>', 'This was already gone by the time I voted, but I would have definitely given this a 10. At least!', '2006-12-11 09:06:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3105912, 434374, 28532, '<td valign="top">Congrats!!!  This is a wonderful shot!!</td>', 'Congrats!!!  This is a wonderful shot!!', '2006-12-11 09:12:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3105921, 433685, 28532, '<td valign="top">Sweet!!! Congrats on the red ribbon!!!</td>', 'Sweet!!! Congrats on the red ribbon!!!', '2006-12-11 09:15:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3105950, 433853, 66384, '<td valign="top">Svetlana, this is so beautiful. It is my favorite of the challenge. I am shocked it didn''t score higher. You have really found a niche with this oil painting style. The costume and styling, pose, backdrop, lighting, and crop are all perfect, and you captured a very alluring expression. I think you could make a living at this. There are many people who would like an Old Masters style "painting" of a family member for their living room. Congratulations on a wonderful entry!</td>', 'Svetlana, this is so beautiful. It is my favorite of the challenge. I am shocked it didn''t score higher. You have really found a niche with this oil painting style. The costume and styling, pose, backdrop, lighting, and crop are all perfect, and you captured a very alluring expression. I think you could make a living at this. There are many people who would like an Old Masters style "painting" of a family member for their living room. Congratulations on a wonderful entry!', '2006-12-11 09:44:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3105951, 434215, 53147, '<td valign="top">Well done Deb! A lovely, warm and clean image. Very nice indeed.</td>', 'Well done Deb! A lovely, warm and clean image. Very nice indeed.', '2006-12-11 09:44:31.000000', NULL, 0),
