(3105983, 434401, 66384, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this the harder I laugh. That undramatic corpse laying there like a sack of potatoes, and you with a "whaaaat?" expression on your face. You KILL me over and over.</td>', 'The more I look at this the harder I laugh. That undramatic corpse laying there like a sack of potatoes, and you with a "whaaaat?" expression on your face. You KILL me over and over.', '2006-12-11 10:01:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3106100, 433896, 51538, '<td valign="top">Indeed, well done.  An inspiring way to shoot the models.  Where there''s a will, there''s a way.  Your shot should be an inspiration to all of those out there with no 5D, no studio, no studio lights etc.  At the end of the day, brilliance can shine through regardless.  An artist is not limited by her/his tools.  Happy Holidays when shortly they come by.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-11 10:43:20.</i></td>', 'Indeed, well done.  An inspiring way to shoot the models.  Where there''s a will, there''s a way.  Your shot should be an inspiration to all of those out there with no 5D, no studio, no studio lights etc.  At the end of the day, brilliance can shine through regardless.  An artist is not limited by her/his tools.  Happy Holidays when shortly they come by.', '2006-12-11 10:42:38.000000', '2006-12-11 10:43:20.000000', 0),
