(3568320, 434215, 67697, '<td valign="top">Wow - this is gorgeous.  I love the gold tones and shadows.  Gives it that mysterious carnivale feel.</td>', 'Wow - this is gorgeous.  I love the gold tones and shadows.  Gives it that mysterious carnivale feel.', '2007-04-21 11:29:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3636596, 433376, 72423, '<td valign="top">My first reaction was ''there is not enough ''touch''''.  More thumb was needed to emphasise this aspect and would have matched the title better IMHO.</td>', 'My first reaction was ''there is not enough ''touch''''.  More thumb was needed to emphasise this aspect and would have matched the title better IMHO.', '2007-05-10 11:00:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3700635, 433376, 78766, '<td valign="top">ahh gold finger! at first, i didnt notice the finger at all because of the gold on her fingernail made it blend in.<br/>i think you have too many of the orchids in the shot. i think 2 at max would convey the message. and yeah, not enough finger to make u think, ahh  flowers to gold. and , I dont know if its just me, but id rather have a darker background to draw the eyes to the gold. You have too much gold in it and they all start to get lost in it.</td>', 'ahh gold finger! at first, i didnt notice the finger at all because of the gold on her fingernail made it blend in.i think you have too many of the orchids in the shot. i think 2 at max would convey the message. and yeah, not enough finger to make u think, ahh  flowers to gold. and , I dont know if its just me, but id rather have a darker background to draw the eyes to the gold. You have too much gold in it and they all start to get lost in it.', '2007-05-27 16:14:32.000000', NULL, 0),
